gnificant things happened the  first is that quan chi  took his soul and turned him into an  undead entity known as noob saibot who  would appear in later installments of  the game the second is that b  han's younger brother takes up the  mantle of sub-zero and would appear as  sub-zero in all of the mortal kombat  sequels now like his brother  huay liang was a member of the lin kuei  clan their father had been living in  america as a spy for the lin kuei and  was descended from a race of cryomancers  magicians with the ability to control  ice and so he takes his sons back to  china and then trains them both to be  assassins for the lin kuei clan now upon  adopting the sub-zero code name kwai  liang vows to finish what his brother  had tried and failed to do  kills shang tsung but he runs into  trouble in the form of a perpetual thorn  in the lin quay side  scorpion now scorpion initially believes  that sub-zero is behind back from the  dead but then realizes that it's not  actually him when he shows mercy to an  opponent and upon learning his true  identity  scorpion vows to be sub-zero's protector  now sub-zero later tries to leave the  lin kuei tribe along with his friend  smoke as they've become disgusted with  the clan's new practice of turning their  members into cyborgs unfortunately  smokes kidnapped and converted into a  cyborg along with two other lin kuei  warriors  cyrax and sector and the three of them  were tasked with hunting sub-zero down  now sub-zero joins raiden's efforts to  protect earth realm from the resurrected  shinnok  and once again finds himself on the  wrong side of scorpion who's yet again  been tricked by quan chi into blaming  sub-zero for his family's death like my  god you'd think scorpion would have  figured it out by now like hey maybe  this guy's just constantly duping me but  in 2002's mortal kombat deadly alliance  we saw a sub-zero challenge sector for  the leadership of the lin quay and  sub-zero wins and then takes on an  apprentice named  frost who would then challenge him to  become the leader of the clan but  sub-zero would defeat her as well now  overall this new sub-zero proves to be a  much more honorable version of the  character than his older brother had  been  frequently outlying himself with the  defenders of earth realm like raiden and  liu kang  against threats like shinnok the elder  god and the dragon king onaka who were  determined to see the realm destroyed  now he has an extremely  strong sense of honor and even after  encountering and defeating his older  brother noob saibot he remains dedicated  to seeing his brother restored to his  former self and now  we reach the point where the mortal  kombat timeline reboots completely with  the release of the 2011 game  simply titled mortal kombat so this  version of sub-zero's story once again  starts with bihan  and he's killed by scorpion and is still  turned into new cybot and just like in  the original timeline  his brother steps up to assume the  mantle of sub-zero to honor his older  brother's death and that's when things  get different in this timeline the lin  kuei are once again turning their  warriors into cyborgs but instead of  smoke getting cyberized like the  original version this time  it's sub-zero that's transformed against  his will and forced to serve xiao kang  the emperor of outworld now sub-zero is  able to overcome this transformation  however and takes up  arms against shao khan alongside raiden  and his forces  he battles and defeats his older brother  but is killed by sindel the wife of xiao  khan and is then revived in the nether  realm as a revenant by quan chi  i gotta be honest guys this dude just  keeps showing up and messing stuff up  for sub-zero and scorpion but anyway we  learned that both of the sub-zero  brothers were actually abducted by the  lin kuei  as babies and that the clan had  essentially killed their parents now  after quan chi resurrects him sub-zero  is forced to serve in his 