bsolute zero so that's  theoretically impossible but it also  kind of makes sense because his name is  sub-zero not absolute zero although i  feel like absolute zero would be an  amazing name for a character in mortal  kombat but sub-zero is also an expert  hand-to-hand combatant and also uses his  powers to make weapons out of ice that  he uses in battle now in mortal kombat x  sub-zero comes into possession of an  artifact called the dragon medallion  which makes his ice powers even stronger  and also gives him  greater control over his cheat which  makes his melee attacks  more damaging as well and yeah that's  basically all you need to know about  sub-zero probably one of the more  interesting characters in mortal kombat  in terms of backstory but i hope you  guys enjoyed this thank you all for  watching and we will catch you guys  later  peace

